sequenceDiagram
    participant Chrome as Chrome navigation
    participant Extension as Extension worker
    participant Blocker as Blocker page
    participant Host as Curfew native host
    participant Curfew as Curfew app
    participant Docket as Docket MCP server
    participant Athena as Athena reviewer

    Docket-->>Curfew: active-work/1 observation
    Curfew->>Curfew: Reduce session and allowlist
    Curfew-->>Host: Signed browser-policy/1 snapshot
    Extension->>Host: get_policy over browser-host/1
    Host-->>Extension: Current snapshot
    Extension->>Chrome: Replace complete dynamic ruleset
    Chrome-->>Extension: Blocked main-frame navigation
    Extension->>Blocker: Opaque request ID
    Blocker->>Extension: Justification in memory
    Extension->>Host: Normalized review_destination
    Host->>Curfew: Signed pending review
    Curfew->>Docket: review_work_destination
    Docket->>Athena: Task context and justification
    Athena-->>Docket: Grant, challenge, or deny
    Docket-->>Curfew: Proposed decision and scope
    Curfew->>Curfew: Validate scope and set lifetime
    Curfew-->>Host: Signed scrubbed result and policy
    Host-->>Extension: Policy result
    Extension->>Chrome: Replace rules before any reopen
